        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いやあ、男極『スピード部門』も、\nハプニングはありましたが大盛況でしたね！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "関係者たち"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_a:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "315プロを含め、小さな事務所が番組で見せた、\n熱い絆が話題になっているようです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "関係者たち"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_a:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あっ。315プロといえば、『モテ部門』の\nJupiter出演回！　あれ、なかなかいい数字で……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "関係者たち"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_a:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "…………。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_a:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（新顔事務所どもめ。私の大会を引っかき回し\nやがって！　このままでは……いや、待てよ）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_a:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（315プロのアイドル達は、元々医者や弁護士で、\nアイドルの世界とは無縁だった者も多いらしい）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_a:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（つまり……アイドルに関する知識は、素人同然！）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_a:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（今までの活躍は、プロデューサーや\n事務所スタッフの力があったからに違いない！）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_a:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（ならばアイドル自身に、\n『アイドルのプロデュース』をさせてやれば……！）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_a:step-29:text",
        "step_id": 29,
        "step_index": 28,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 28
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "コホン。君たち、次のテーマなんだが……。\n男極『プロデュース部門』なんていうのはどうだ？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_04_a:step-31:text",
        "step_id": 31,
        "step_index": 30,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_04_a",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_04_a.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 31,
          "target_step_index": 30
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "アイドルが、一般人をアイドルに変身させるんだ！\n……面白そうじゃないか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
